cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "GOWC — Global Observatory Weather Tracker"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Ahzam
    family-names: Ahmed
    email: ahzamahd641@gmail.com
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-3864-0934"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AhzamAhd/observatory-weather"
url: "https://gowcastroclimate.com"
abstract: >-
  GOWC is an open tool for observing-conditions prediction and observation
  planning across ~2,600 catalogued observatory sites. It computes seeing,
  airmass, atmospheric extinction, precipitable water vapour, sky brightness and
  signal-to-noise ratio from live Open-Meteo meteorology, validated against ESO
  Astronomical Site Monitor DIMM/MASS/LHATPRO data and the ING SIGNAL ETC.
license: MIT
